From: Folia Compatibility Patch
Subject: [PATCH 0010] UpdateChecker: Migrate to GlobalRegionScheduler and AsyncScheduler

AE PATCH REASON: Bukkit scheduler incompatible with Folia plugin lifecycle
AE PATCH FIX: Migrate to GlobalRegionScheduler and AsyncScheduler
AE PATCH RISK: LOW
AE PATCH EXCLUDES: net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/plugin/UpdateChecker.class, net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/plugin/UpdateChecker$*.class

---
diff --git a/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/plugin/UpdateChecker.java b/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/plugin/UpdateChecker.java
index b53aa9e..fb1e6ad 100644
--- a/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/plugin/UpdateChecker.java
+++ b/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/plugin/UpdateChecker.java
@@ -1,7 +1,6 @@
 package net.advancedplugins.ae.impl.utils.plugin;
 
